The DAR file in this directory is daml-props 0.1.0, a property-based testing
library for Daml from the OpenZeppelin daml-props project:

  https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/daml-props
  commit 901571e509e899f3b2870fe9baaa6fc4ad8ff21b

It was built unmodified from that commit with Daml SDK 3.4.10 (`dpm build`) and
is used only by test packages. Upstream marks the library as experimental.
`dpm test --all` also runs the four example scripts shipped in the DAR.
